      "message": "This change is if any one of the profiles is disabled or enabled, the phone don\u0027t connect all supported profile, but connect the profile that connect policy is not FORBIDDEN instead.\n\nSo if the headset LE audio related profiles connection policy is change to FORBIDDEN, the phone still connect the other profile which connection policy is unknown (connectEnabledProfiles)",
